    <elementInformations>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Sigenergy</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">11110031</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Sigen Energy Gateway HomePro TP</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">gateway/backup; komunikacija: 2x FE (RJ45, J5/J6), RS485 P6 (rezervirano), DI1 zasilni izklop, DI2/DI3 ATS (P8), DO1/DO2/DO3 preklopni (P10), DO3 = 2-žilni zagon agregata</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Energy Gateway HomePro (SP / SP-F / TP), Version 20260618, Sigenergy str. 2; Sigen Gateway HomePro TP Installation Guide, v03 (2025-09-21); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomePro TP Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost), 5-6 (kabli, odklopnik INV2), 15 (L1 L2 L3 N PE), 16-17 (P6/J5/J6/P10/P8); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">25</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">450</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">695</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">163</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
    <informations>Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Energy Gateway HomePro (SP / SP-F / TP), Version 20260618, Sigenergy str. 2; Sigen Gateway HomePro TP Installation Guide, v03 (2025-09-21); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomePro TP Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost), 5-6 (kabli, odklopnik INV2), 15 (L1 L2 L3 N PE), 16-17 (P6/J5/J6/P10/P8); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway
Drawn with terminals2qet 0.2.0 from the terminal table</informations>
